WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.962
WEF Davos Connections.

00:00:02.912 --> 00:00:12.175
Our grandfathers didn t storm Juno Beach so that eighty years later unelected foreign billionaires could dictate Canadian policy at Swiss ski resorts.

00:00:12.175 --> 00:00:18.087
Klaus Schwab said it on video, at Harvard, on the record: We penetrate the cabinets.

00:00:18.087 --> 00:00:31.625
This report documents which Canadian politicians are connected to the World Economic Forum, who attended Davos on your dime, and where WEF white papers became Canadian law all from verifiable public sources.
